#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:1
msgid "D13 接口与接线"
msgstr "D13 Connector and Wiring"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:3
msgid "适用范围"
msgstr "Scope"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:6
msgid ""
"本页适用于 **HM-D13-4G、HM-D13-LoRa 移动站**和 LoRa 套件中的专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件。移动站使用 "
"5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口；基站对外仅使用封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆。"
msgstr ""
"This page applies to **HM-D13-4G, HM-D13-LoRa rovers** and the dedicated "
"D13 LoRa base station hardware in the LoRa kit. The rover uses a 5-pin "
"GH1.25 mm interface; the base station externally only uses a sealed 4-pin"
" USB cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:9
msgid "移动站 5-pin GH1.25 mm 定义"
msgstr "Rover 5-pin GH1.25 mm Definition"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:11
msgid ""
"D13 移动站使用带防反插结构的 5-pin XH 2.54 mm 接口。接线时必须按接口 Pin 1–5 顺序和XH "
"2.54端子线方向核对，不能只通过导线颜色判断功能。"
msgstr ""
"The D13 rover uses a 5-pin XH 2.54 mm connector with an anti-reverse "
"structure. When wiring, verify the Pin 1–5 order and the direction of the "
"XH 2.54 terminal wire according to the connector. Do not rely only on wire "
"color to determine the function."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:14
msgid ""
"上电前核对 5-pin 定义 保持设备断电，只允许 Pin 2（VCC）连接 5 V ±0.5 V 电源正极、Pin 1（GND）连接电源负极。若"
" Pin 顺序与本文定义无法对应，请勿上电，并联系技术支持确认。"
msgstr ""
"Before powering on, check the 5-pin definitions. Keep the device powered "
"off, and only connect Pin 2 (VCC) to the positive terminal of a 5 V ±0.5 "
"V power supply, and Pin 1 (GND) to the negative terminal. If the pin "
"sequence does not match the definitions in this document, do not power on"
" and contact technical support for confirmation."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:17
msgid "![alt text](../images/D13_rover_connect.png)"
msgstr "![D13 rover connector wiring](../images/D13_rover_connect.png)"

