msgstr "Power negative and signal reference ground"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:28
msgid "串口与供电边界"
msgstr "Serial and power requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:30
msgid "必须同时满足"
msgstr "Must be met simultaneously"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:33
msgid "**设备供电**：5 V ±0.5 V（4.5–5.5 V）。"
msgstr "**Device Power Supply**: 5 V ±0.5 V (4.5–5.5 V)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:34
msgid "**UART I/O 电平**：3.3 V。"
msgstr "**UART IO level**: 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:35
msgid "**PPS I/O 电平**：3.3 V。"
msgstr "**PPS I/O level**: 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:36
msgid "**默认串口**：115200 bps、8 数据位、1 停止位、无校验、无流控。"
msgstr ""
"**Default serial port**: 115200 bps, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, no parity, "
"no flow control."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:37
msgid "**接口限制**：禁止向 UART 或 PPS 接入 5 V 信号，禁止直接连接 RS232 接口。"
msgstr ""
"**Interface restrictions**: Do not apply 5 V to UART or PPS, and do not "
"connect RS232 directly."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:41
msgid "**5 V 供电不等于 5 V 串口电平。**"
msgstr "**5 V power is not 5 V UART logic.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:43
msgid ""
"Pin 2（VCC）的 **5 V** 仅用于设备供电；Pin 3（RXD）、Pin 4（TXD）和 Pin 5（PPS）的 I/O 电平均为 "
"**3.3 V**。禁止使用 5 V UART 转接器或把任何 5 V 信号接入 RXD、TXD、PPS，否则可能造成设备永久性损坏。请使用标配 "
"USB 转 UART 转接器，或在接线前确认飞控、主控的 UART/PPS 电平兼容 3.3 V。"
msgstr ""
"Pin 2 (VCC, **5 V**) is for device power only. Pin 3 (RXD), Pin 4 (TXD), "
"and Pin 5 (PPS) all use **3.3 V** I/O. Do not use a 5 V UART adapter or "
"apply any 5 V signal to RXD, TXD, or PPS; doing so may permanently damage"
" the device. Use the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, or verify that the "
"flight-controller or host UART/PPS interface supports 3.3 V logic before "
"wiring."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:46
msgid "移动站首次接线"
msgstr "First wiring of the rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:48
msgid "设备断电，按 Pin 1–5 顺序和信号定义确认电源电压与极性。"
msgstr ""
"Power off the device, and verify the power voltage and polarity according"
" to the order and signal definitions of Pin 1–5."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:49
msgid "Pin 2（VCC）接 5 V，Pin 1（GND）接电源地。"
msgstr ""
"Pin 2 (VCC) is connected to 5 V, and Pin 1 (GND) is connected to the "
"power ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:50
msgid "Pin 4（TXD）接外部设备 RX，Pin 3（RXD）接外部设备 TX。"
msgstr ""
"Pin 4 (TXD) connects to the RX of the external device, and Pin 3 (RXD) "
"connects to the TX of the external device."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:51
msgid "D13 与标配 USB 转 UART 转接器、飞控或主控共地，并确认对方 UART 为 3.3 V I/O 电平。"
msgstr ""
"When using the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, a flight controller, or a "
"host controller, connect its ground to D13 ground and verify that its "
"UART uses 3.3 V I/O."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:52
msgid "需要时间同步时连接 Pin 5（PPS），并确认目标输入兼容 3.3 V。"
msgstr ""
"Connect Pin 5 (PPS) for time synchronization and verify that the target "
"input supports 3.3 V."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:53
msgid "确认连接后上电。"
msgstr "Power on after confirming the connection."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:55
msgid "接线完成判据"
msgstr "Wiring success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:58
msgid "上电后设备持续输出定位数据，供电稳定，线缆和连接器无异常发热或松动。"
msgstr ""
"After powering on, the device continuously outputs positioning data, the "
"power supply is stable, and the cables and connectors show no abnormal "
"heating or looseness."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:61
msgid "专用 D13 LoRa 基站 USB 连接"
msgstr "Dedicated D13 LoRa base-station USB connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:63
msgid ""
"套件基站对外仅使用封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆，不向用户暴露内部接口线。将配套线缆连接基站后，可以直接插入 USB "
"电源为基站供电；连接电脑时，除供电外还可进行 USB 串口通信。"
msgstr ""
"The kit base station exposes only its sealed 4-pin USB cable, with no "
"internal wires accessible to the user. Connect the cable to a USB power "
"source for power, or to a computer for both power and USB serial "
"communication."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:65
msgid "基站日常架设只需连接配套 USB 线缆和外置 LoRa 天线。不要拆开线缆、改接内部导线或使用非配套转接线。"
msgstr ""
"Daily setup of the base station only requires connecting the supplied USB"
" cable and external LoRa antenna. Do not disassemble the cable, reconnect"
" internal wires, or use non-matching adapter cables."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:67
msgid ""
"连接基站外置 LoRa 天线后再上电。基站上电后保持静止，具体要求见[LoRa 基站架设](../differential-links/d13"
"-base-station.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the external LoRa antenna to the base station before powering on."
" Keep the base station stationary after powering on; for specific "
"requirements, see [Setting Up the LoRa Base Station](../differential-"
"links/d13-base-station.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:69
msgid "4G 版本维护接口"
msgstr "4G Version Maintenance Interface"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/d13-wiring.md:71
msgid ""
"HM-D13-4G 的 Nano-SIM 卡槽和 USB-C 配置口位于顶壳内部。安装 SIM 卡或配置 CORS/NTRIP "
"账号前应断开外部电源，完成操作后恢复顶壳并确认装配可靠。"
msgstr ""
"The Nano-SIM card slot and USB-C configuration port of the HM-D13-4G are "
"located inside the top cover. The external power should be disconnected "
"before installing the SIM card or configuring the CORS/NTRIP account. "
"After completing the operation, restore the top cover and ensure the "
"assembly is secure."

